<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LiveUX FileManagerBundle — Mobile Showcase Studio</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        html, body {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 18% 22%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25), transparent 50%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 82% 78%, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.25), transparent 50%),
                        linear-gradient(135deg, #060b18 0%, #0f172a 55%, #161433 100%);
            color: #f8fafc;
        }
        .studio {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 440px;
            align-items: center;
            max-width: 1520px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 80px;
            gap: 64px;
        }
        .studio::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background-image: url('/images/liveux-logo.webp');
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-position: 40px bottom;
            background-size: 420px 420px;
            opacity: 0.06;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .info {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 24px;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.16);
            border: 1px solid rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.3);
            color: #93c5fd;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            width: fit-content;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.08;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        }
        .grad {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #60a5fa, #c084fc);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }
        .desc {
            font-size: 19px;
            line-height: 1.55;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            max-width: 660px;
        }
        .feature-list {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 14px;
            max-width: 680px;
        }
        .feat {
            padding: 16px 18px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.72);
            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22);
        }
        .feat strong {
            display: block;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #f8fafc;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .feat span {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        .phone-wrap {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .phone {
            width: 414px;
            height: 868px;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 48px;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #334155, #0f172a);
            box-shadow: 0 36px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65),
                        0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14) inset;
            position: relative;
        }
        .phone-notch {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 112px;
            height: 24px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #020617;
            z-index: 10;
        }
        .phone-screen {
            width: 390px;
            height: 844px;
            border-radius: 38px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: none;
            display: block;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="studio">
        <div class="info">
            <div class="badge">Mobile-First Adaptive UX</div>
            <h1>
                <span class="grad">Native App Feel</span><br>
                On Every Screen Size
            </h1>
            <p class="desc">
                Automatically adapts below <code>768px</code> into edge-to-edge <code>100dvh</code> fullscreen modals or rounded bottom sheets with swipeable folder drawers and touch-friendly action sheets.
            </p>
            <div class="feature-list">
                <div class="feat">
                    <strong>Edge-to-Edge Fullscreen</strong>
                    <span>Zero wasted borders on phones with clean 2-row topbar and sticky footer.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="feat">
                    <strong>Native Bottom Sheet</strong>
                    <span>Rounded top handle drawer via <code>mobileMode: 'sheet'</code> or OffCanvas bottom.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="feat">
                    <strong>Slide-In Folder Drawer</strong>
                    <span>Auto-collapsed tree opens smoothly on tap with backdrop auto-close.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="feat">
                    <strong>Touch Action Sheets</strong>
                    <span>Context menus &amp; gallery reordering work effortlessly with thumb gestures.</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="phone-wrap">
            <div class="phone">
                <div class="phone-notch"></div>
                <iframe
                    id="mobile-demo-frame"
                    class="phone-screen"
                    src="/modals?theme={{ activeTheme }}&icon_set={{ activeIconSet }}&locale={{ activeLocale }}&scheme={{ activeScheme }}"
                    title="LiveUX FileManagerBundle Mobile View"
                ></iframe>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
